LVM 1.0.1-rc4 has been released.  This release fixes the kernel compile err=
or:

    undefined reference to `__update_hardsectsize'
or
    warning: `__update_hardsectsize' declared `static' but never defined
    warning: `__update_hardblocksize' defined but not used

Other than that it is identical to the rc3 release. =20

A tarball is available now at=20

        <http://www.sistina.com/>
	  =20
